# sirna-repro (Martinelli, bioRxiv 10.1101/2023.08.16.553554) supplementary
# training data (907 siRNAs, siRNAmod-derived): NOT integrated into the loader
# -- no gene/target-identity column (same disqualifier as Shmushkovich 2018),
# only sequence + chemical modification + PCT + a source PMID/patent-ID that
# would require per-document tracing (30 documents, one patent = 60% of rows)
# to recover gene identity. Kept locally for reference, never committed.
# See data/POTENTIAL_DATA_SOURCES.md / data/DATA_SOURCE_LEDGER.md.
data/raw/sirna_repro_martinelli_907.csv
